:"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"不可為了查房方便放在病人單位"}]},{"type":"text","value":"，也不可請病人"},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"自行攜帶"}]},{"type":"text","value":"去檢查室(由專人傳送或系統傳輸)。"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"保密"}]},{"type":"text","value":"：醫療機構及其人員因業務知悉的病人病情或健康資訊"},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"不得無故洩漏"}]},{"type":"text","value":"(醫療法第 72 條)；護理人員因業務知悉的秘密，非依法或經"},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"當事人或法定代理人書面同意"}]},{"type":"text","value":"不得洩漏(護理人員法第 28 條)。"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"病歷、醫療、健康檢查等屬於個人資料保護法第 6 條的特種個資，原則上"},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"不得蒐集、處理或利用"}]},{"type":"text","value":"，例外包括法律明文規定、"},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"當事人書面同意"}]},{"type":"text","value":"等。"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"誰可以看："},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"ul","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"家屬或訪客詢問病情"}]},{"type":"text","value":"：護理人員不能自己回答病歷內容，要"},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"經病人同意"}]},{"type":"text","value":"；病情與預後的說明屬於醫師的權責。"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"病人本人"}]},{"type":"text","value":"可以要求"},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"病歷複製本"}]},{"type":"text","value":"，必要時提供中文病歷摘要，不得無故拖延或拒絕，費用由病人負擔(醫療法第 71 條)。"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"研究"}]},{"type":"text","value":"需要調閱病歷：要通過"},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"人體研究倫理審查(IRB)"}]},{"type":"text","value":"並依院內規定申請，不可自行調閱。"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"電子病歷的管理(《醫療機構電子病歷製作及管理辦法》)：要有"},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"權限管控"}]},{"type":"text","value":"、系統安全、傳輸"},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"加密"}]},{"type":"text","value":"等機制；發生"},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"安全事故"}]},{"type":"text","value":"要通知當事人，且影響營運或當事人權益時"},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"72 小時內"}]},{"type":"text","value":"通報主管機關。臨床上離開行動工作車要"},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"關閉螢幕"}]},{"type":"text","value":"，帳號密碼自行妥善保管。"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"}]}]}},{"id":"informed-consent","depth":2,"number":"四、","title":"知情同意","children":[],"content":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"p","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"知情同意"}]},{"type":"text","value":"是病人在充分了解"},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"病情、治療方針、處置、用藥、預後與可能的不良反應"}]},{"type":"text","value":"後，自己決定要